{
 "esm": "1.1.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "WildlandFireBehavior",
  "description": "The fire-behavior half of EqAtmFire: NCAR's Community Fire Behavior Model (WRF 4.8 phys/fire_behavior) for one fire cell and its level set, with the nine per-cell components coupled to each other by reference instead of each being driven by its own dumped inputs. The chain is fuel category -> Anderson-13 table -> (fuel load, depth, SAVR, extinction moisture, burn weight) ; 2 m temperature/humidity/pressure -> five-class time-lag fuel moisture -> the cell's bulk moisture state and d(fmc_g)/dt ; (fuel, moisture) -> Rothermel reaction intensity, packing ratio, wind/slope coefficients and the no-wind spread r_0 ; (Rothermel, mid-flame wind, terrain slope, front normal) -> rate of spread ; ros -> the level-set PDE d psi/dt = -R |grad psi| + nu |R| (dx psi_xx + dy psi_yy) ; the level set -> ignition time and, through the subcell quadrature, the fuel fraction left and the fuel consumption RATE ; (burn rate, load, moisture) -> the sensible and latent heat flux that FireAtmosphereColumn hands to the atmosphere. THE THREE TENDENCIES ARE d psi/dt (level set, 80 x 80), dfuel_frac_dt (fuel burn rate of the cell) and dfmc_g_dt (bulk fuel moisture); everything else is a diagnostic on the way to them. WHAT IS LOAD-BEARING: the only numbers prescribed here are the ones the fire model receives from OUTSIDE itself (the fuel category, the 2 m forcing, the mid-flame wind and terrain slope, the front normal, the level-set stencil and the previous step's fuel fraction) plus the level-set field itself; every quantity that one fire-behavior component computes for another travels a coupling edge. Deleting any of the 17 inter-mount edges makes a Fortran-dump assertion fail. STAGING, measured not assumed: fire_behavior evaluates its stages sequentially within a step, and two of the couplings are therefore not bit-identical to the Fortran. (i) Calc_ros_params runs on the fuel moisture BEFORE Advance_moisture_classes updates it and Calc_fire_fluxes runs on the moisture AFTER, while a continuous formulation must evaluate both at one instantaneous state; this document feeds both the state, fmc_g_state = sum_k w_k fmc_old_k, which is what Rothermel sees exactly (2e-8 relative) and what the flux sees to 7.9e-7 relative -- inside the real32 tolerance, so no assertion is loosened for it. (ii) Calc_flame_length is called before Calc_fuel_left with the PREVIOUS step's fire_area and the LAST Runge-Kutta stage's ros, so its two inputs are prescribed from the dump rather than taken from the coupling, and the document says so rather than pretending the edge exists. Regime: cell (18, 64) of the 80 x 80 fire mesh at step 20 (ts = 10 s, dt = 0.5 s) of the fire_behavior test7 standalone run with the fuel-moisture model active, Anderson category 2 (timber with grass understory), a heading front with fire_area = 0.957 and a 0.40 m/s spread rate. The level set is Runge-Kutta stage 1 of that step with the default fire_upwinding = 9 (hybrid WENO5 in a 4-cell band around the front, ENO1 outside, guarded linear-extrapolation halo), lowered by the EarthSciDiscretizations cartesian_uniform_2d rules. References: dumps fire/run_fmc/esm_dump_{fmc,fmc_avg,ros_params,ls_tend,ls_tign,fuel_left,flame,fire_flux}_*.json, instrumented fork ctessum-claude/fire_behavior @ c9dda02, real32, rel 1e-5. Run as `./esm test couplings/wildlandfire_behavior.esm` with ESD_ROOT set.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "assembly",
   "coupling",
   "wildland_fire",
   "fire_behavior",
   "level-set"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "NCAR Community Fire Behavior Model (fire_behavior), develop @ eb77580; instrumented fork ctessum-claude/fire_behavior branch earthsciml-instrumented @ c9dda02. test7 standalone run with fmoist_run = .true., fire_upwinding = 9; dumps data/eqwefic/dumps/fire/run_fmc/."
   },
   {
    "citation": "Munoz-Esparza, D., B. Kosovic, J. Jimenez and J. Coen (2018), An accurate fire-spread algorithm in the Weather Research and Forecasting model using the level-set method, JAMES 10, 908-926, doi:10.1002/2017MS001108."
   }
  ]
 },
 "metaparameters": {
  "NX": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 80,
   "description": "Fire-mesh cells in x (test7 ifde - ifds + 1 = 80); bound into the level-set grid and its discretization rules."
  },
  "NY": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 80,
   "description": "Fire-mesh cells in y."
  },
  "GX_SRC": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 19,
   "description": "Atmosphere-grid columns in x of the test7 standalone case (ide - ids = 19); bound into the mount edge of FireWindHinterpWRFFire."
  },
  "GY_SRC": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 19,
   "description": "Atmosphere-grid columns in y."
  },
  "NZW": {
   "type": "integer",
   "default": 44,
   "description": "Atmosphere w-levels the standalone hands the wind interpolation (kime - kims + 1 = kde - 1 = 44, FORTRAN_BUGS N54); bound into the mount edge of FireWindWRFFire."
  }
 },
 "models": {
  "Fuel": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/anderson13_fuel_table.esm"
  },
  "Moisture": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/fuel_moisture_wrffire.esm",
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/tests/moisture_run_step20_timber_grass_understory_inputs.esm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Roth": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/rothermel_wrffire.esm"
  },
  "Ros": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/ros_wrffire.esm"
  },
  "Ign": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/ignition_time_wrffire.esm"
  },
  "FuelFrac": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/fuel_fraction_cell.esm"
  },
  "Flame": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/flame_length_wrffire.esm"
  },
  "HeatFlux": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/level_set/fire_heat_flux.esm"
  },
  "LevelSet": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/level_set_tendency_wrffire.esm",
   "bindings": {
    "NX": "NX",
    "NY": "NY"
   },
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/weno5_eno1_norm_D2_extrapolate_bc.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NX": "NX",
      "NY": "NY"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/weno5_eno1_D1x_extrapolate_bc.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NX": "NX",
      "NY": "NY"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/weno5_eno1_D1y_extrapolate_bc.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NX": "NX",
      "NY": "NY"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D2x_extrapolate_bc.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NX": "NX",
      "NY": "NY"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "${ESD_ROOT}/grids/cartesian_uniform_2d/rules/central_D2y_extrapolate_bc.esm",
     "bindings": {
      "NX": "NX",
      "NY": "NY"
     }
    },
    {
     "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/tests/weno5_eno1_fmc_step20_stage1_inputs.esm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Wind": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/fire_wind_wrffire.esm",
   "bindings": {
    "NZW": "NZW"
   },
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/tests/standalone_call10_cell_5_16_inputs.esm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Hinterp": {
   "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/fire_wind_hinterp_wrffire.esm",
   "bindings": {
    "NX": "NX",
    "NY": "NY",
    "GX_SRC": "GX_SRC",
    "GY_SRC": "GY_SRC"
   },
   "expression_template_imports": [
    {
     "ref": "../components/wildland_fire/fire_behavior/tests/hinterp_step20_inputs.esm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "WildlandFireBehavior": {
   "variables": {
    "code": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: Anderson fuel category of the cell (nfuel_cat = 2, timber with grass understory)."
    },
    "t2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: 2 m temperature over the fire cell at the end of the moisture step."
    },
    "t2_old": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "K",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: 2 m temperature at the start of the moisture step."
    },
    "q2": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: 2 m water-vapour mixing ratio at the end of the step."
    },
    "q2_old": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/kg",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: 2 m mixing ratio at the start of the step."
    },
    "psfc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: surface pressure at the end of the step."
    },
    "psfc_old": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "Pa",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: surface pressure at the start of the step."
    },
    "nvx": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: x component of the upwind front normal at the cell (level_set_mod Calc_tend_ls; the level set supplies it to ROS in the Fortran, but the normal the hybrid scheme forms is not the one the component exposes, so it is prescribed here)."
    },
    "nvy": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: y component of the upwind front normal."
    },
    "uf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "Mid-flame wind u at the coupled fire cell, now COUPLED: FireWindWRFFire interpolates the atmosphere profile of column (5,16) to 1 m, FireWindHinterpWRFFire puts that column into the 19 x 19 atmosphere field and interpolates bilinearly onto fire cell (18,64), and the result drives ROSWRFFire."
    },
    "vf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "Mid-flame wind v at the coupled fire cell, now COUPLED: FireWindWRFFire interpolates the atmosphere profile of column (5,16) to 1 m, FireWindHinterpWRFFire puts that column into the 19 x 19 atmosphere field and interpolates bilinearly onto fire cell (18,64), and the result drives ROSWRFFire."
    },
    "dzdxf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: terrain slope dz/dx on the fire mesh."
    },
    "dzdyf": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: terrain slope dz/dy."
    },
    "ts": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: model time at the start of the fire step."
    },
    "lfn_in": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: level set at the cell before the propagation of this step (Update_ignition_times lfn_in)."
    },
    "lfn_out": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: level set at the cell after the propagation of this step."
    },
    "tign_before": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: ignition time held at the cell before this step."
    },
    "lfn_mm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: level set at node (i-1, j-1) of the 3 x 3 stencil Calc_fuel_left reads."
    },
    "lfn_m0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i-1, j)."
    },
    "lfn_mp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i-1, j+1)."
    },
    "lfn_0m": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i, j-1)."
    },
    "lfn_00": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at the cell node (i, j)."
    },
    "lfn_0p": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i, j+1)."
    },
    "lfn_pm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i+1, j-1)."
    },
    "lfn_p0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i+1, j)."
    },
    "lfn_pp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Level set at node (i+1, j+1)."
    },
    "tign_mm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: ignition time at node (i-1, j-1)."
    },
    "tign_m0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i-1, j)."
    },
    "tign_mp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i-1, j+1)."
    },
    "tign_0m": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i, j-1)."
    },
    "tign_00": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at the cell node (i, j)."
    },
    "tign_0p": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i, j+1)."
    },
    "tign_pm": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i+1, j-1)."
    },
    "tign_p0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i+1, j)."
    },
    "tign_pp": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at node (i+1, j+1)."
    },
    "time_now": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: time_start + dt, the time Calc_fuel_left evaluates the subcell exponentials at."
    },
    "fuel_frac_before": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: fuel fraction left at the cell at the end of the previous step."
    },
    "flame_ros": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "Prescribed, NOT coupled: the rate of spread Calc_flame_length sees. WRF calls it before Calc_fuel_left with grid%ros as the LAST Runge-Kutta stage of the step left it, not the stage-1 ros this document couples (0.4015839 against 0.4034055), so wiring Ros.ros here would change the reference."
    },
    "flame_iboros": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed, NOT coupled: reaction intensity over rate of spread as Calc_flame_length sees it (same staging as flame_ros; equal to Roth.iboros to 3e-6)."
    },
    "flame_fire_area": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed, NOT coupled: the burning-area fraction Calc_flame_length sees, which is the PREVIOUS step's (0.8145828 against this step's 0.9570873) because it runs before Calc_fuel_left."
    },
    "h_fuel": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "J/kg",
     "description": "Prescribed EXTERNAL input: heat of combustion of dry fuel (fire_behavior CMBCNST = 17.433 MJ/kg)."
    },
    "i_coupled": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed: x index of the fire cell whose rate of spread the mounted ROSWRFFire drives in the level set."
    },
    "j_coupled": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Prescribed: y index of that cell."
    },
    "fgi_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Fuel.fgi."
    },
    "fuel_time_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Fuel.fuel_time."
    },
    "fmc_g_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Moisture.fmc_g."
    },
    "fmc_g_state_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Moisture.fmc_g_state."
    },
    "dfmc_g_dt_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Moisture.dfmc_g_dt."
    },
    "betafl_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Roth.betafl."
    },
    "bbb_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Roth.bbb."
    },
    "phiwc_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Roth.phiwc."
    },
    "r_0_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Roth.r_0."
    },
    "iboros_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Roth.iboros."
    },
    "ros_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Ros.ros."
    },
    "speed_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Ros.speed."
    },
    "tign_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Ign.tign."
    },
    "fire_area_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives FuelFrac.fire_area."
    },
    "fuel_frac_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives FuelFrac.fuel_frac."
    },
    "fuel_frac_burnt_dt_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives FuelFrac.fuel_frac_burnt_dt."
    },
    "dfuel_frac_dt_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1/s",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives FuelFrac.dfuel_frac_dt."
    },
    "flame_length_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives Flame.flame_length."
    },
    "phi_h_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives HeatFlux.phi_h."
    },
    "phi_q_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives HeatFlux.phi_q."
    },
    "dpsi_dt_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "shape": [
      "x",
      "y"
     ],
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives LevelSet.tend, the level-set tendency field."
    },
    "grad_mag_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "1",
     "shape": [
      "x",
      "y"
     ],
     "default": 0.0,
     "description": "Receives LevelSet.grad_mag."
    },
    "fgi": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "kg/m^2",
     "description": "Oven-dry surface fuel load of the cell's category."
    },
    "fuel_time": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Fuel e-folding burn time weight/0.85."
    },
    "fmc_g": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Bulk fuel moisture after the moisture step (Average_moisture_classes)."
    },
    "fmc_g_state": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Bulk fuel moisture STATE, the weighted mean of the class moistures at the start of the step; what Rothermel and the flux are evaluated at."
    },
    "dfmc_g_dt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/s",
     "description": "TENDENCY: d(fmc_g)/dt of the cell."
    },
    "betafl": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Rothermel packing ratio."
    },
    "bbb": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Rothermel wind exponent B."
    },
    "phiwc": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Rothermel wind coefficient C (beta/betaop)^-E."
    },
    "r_0": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "No-wind, no-slope spread rate in ft/min."
    },
    "iboros": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Reaction intensity over rate of spread (Btu/ft^2)."
    },
    "ros": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "Rate of spread of the cell along the front normal."
    },
    "speed": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "description": "Mid-flame wind speed projected on the front normal."
    },
    "tign": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "s",
     "description": "Ignition time at the cell after this step."
    },
    "fire_area": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Burning-area fraction of the cell."
    },
    "fuel_frac": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Fuel fraction left at the cell."
    },
    "fuel_frac_burnt_dt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "Fuel fraction consumed over this fire step."
    },
    "dfuel_frac_dt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1/s",
     "description": "TENDENCY: fuel consumption rate of the cell."
    },
    "flame_length": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m",
     "description": "Flame length at the front."
    },
    "phi_h": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "Sensible heat flux of the cell handed to the atmosphere (fire_behavior fgrnhfx)."
    },
    "phi_q": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "W/m^2",
     "description": "Latent heat flux of the cell (fgrnqfx)."
    },
    "dpsi_dt": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "m/s",
     "shape": [
      "x",
      "y"
     ],
     "description": "TENDENCY: d psi/dt of the level set over the fire mesh."
    },
    "grad_mag": {
     "type": "unknown",
     "units": "1",
     "description": "|grad psi| at the coupled cell."
    },
    "uf_in": {
     "type": "parameter",
     "units": "m/s",
     "default": 0.0,
